Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); not submitted upstream.
GCC 16.2.0 with Iain Sandoe's Darwin port and the pkgsrc patches.
Add an explicit AArch64 Darwin LLVM MC command language and Mach-O LLD
platform record. Keep collect2, LTO, libraries, start files and constructors.
This is a default-CPU pilot. Other assembler modes keep their defaults.
GCC source retains its GPLv3+ licence and upstream copyright notices.

